OL,4,CSocial club fire believed to be arson  
OL,5,GA fire at a former social club is      
OL,6,Gbelieved to have been started          
OL,7,Gdeliberately, firefighters have        
OL,8,Gconfirmed.                             
OL,10,FCrews responded to the blaze at the    
OL,11,Fhistoric Standard Triumph Club, on     
OL,12,FTile Hill Lane, Coventry, shortly      
OL,13,Fafter 19:55 GMT on Tuesday.            
OL,15,FFour fire engines and two hydraulic    
OL,16,Faerial platforms from Coventry,        
OL,17,FCanley, Foleshill, Binley and Highgate 
OL,18,Fattended the scene.                    
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
