OL,4,CYoung butcher takes on world           
OL,5,Ccompetitions                           
OL,6,GA young butcher is preparing to        
OL,7,Grepresent her country at two           
OL,8,Ginternational competitions and hopes   
OL,9,Gto inspire other young people to take  
OL,10,Gup the profession.                     
OL,12,FTia Williams, who has her own          
OL,13,Fbutcher's shop in Shrewsbury, is due   
OL,14,Fto fly to Las Vegas for World Butcher  
OL,15,FWars in April and will then head to    
OL,16,Fanother event in Australia in 2028.    
OL,18,FThe 21-year-old started when she was   
OL,19,Fjust 14 and said: "I really like the   
OL,20,Fconnection of... knowing where your    
OL,21,Ffood comes from."                      
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
