OL,4,CMan and daughter who dumped body in    
OL,5,Ccanal jailed                           
OL,6,GA man and his daughter who disposed of 
OL,7,Ga woman's body in a canal, after she   
OL,8,Gwas murdered in a "brutal" attack by   
OL,9,Gthe father, have been jailed.          
OL,11,FChereiss Bailey was found dead near a  
OL,12,Fwaterway off Ryders Green Road in West 
OL,13,FBromwich, West Midlands, in October    
OL,14,Flast year.                             
OL,16,FJohn Anslow, 65, assaulted the 36-year-
OL,17,Fold victim at his home before he and   
OL,18,FHayley-Marie Ferguson, 42, moved her   
OL,19,Fbody in a wheelchair and used a        
OL,20,Fwashing line with paving slabs         
OL,21,Fattached to submerge it in the water.  
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
